Package: mpv
Version: @DEB_MPV_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://mpv.io
Depends: libwayland0, libxkbcommon0, libass9, libavcodec59, libavformat59, libavutil57, libswscale6, libswresample4, libavfilter8, libfreetype6, libfontconfig1, libharfbuzz0b, libfribidi0, libjpeg62-turbo, libpulse0
Description: Wayland-native GPU media player
 mpv is a free, cross-platform media player. This build (0.36.0) targets the
 iosc Wayland compositor: the OpenGL video renderer (--vo=gpu) drives the
 desktop EGL/GLES stack on a wl_surface via wayland-egl for zero-copy GPU
 video, with libass subtitle rendering. Audio output is via PulseAudio
 (the desktop PA daemon). Runs as a native Wayland client.
